{"id":"n85360-1-10","stage":5,"title":"항로 · 航线","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85360-1-10-1","ko":"선장님, 저기 웬 불빛이 보입니다.","zh":"船长，那边有灯光在闪烁。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선장님,","meaning":"船长","explanation":"선장：船长；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"선장","audio":"/audio/e9fb7af351d5307264f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44907","senseId":"1","lemma":"선장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웬","meaning":"什么，哪儿来的","explanation":"웬：什么，哪儿来的","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불빛이","meaning":"灯光","explanation":"불빛：灯光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"불빛","audio":"/audio/fa0d7fb8510db5921f34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60673","senseId":"2","lemma":"불빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보입니다.","meaning":"让看见","explanation":"보이다：让看见；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"1","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e9fb7af351d53072","term":"선장","zh":"船长","audio":"/audio/e9fb7af351d5307264f3.mp3","entryId":"44907","definition":"监督船上的船员并负责船的航海和事务的人。","pronunciation":["선장"]},{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"0eb778191ab3a0e5","term":"웬","zh":"什么，哪儿来的","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3","entryId":"69527","definition":"不知道怎么回事。","pronunciation":["웬ː"]},{"id":"fa0d7fb8510db592","term":"불빛","zh":"灯光","audio":"/audio/fa0d7fb8510db5921f34.mp3","entryId":"60673","definition":"打开的灯里发出的亮光。","pronunciation":["불삗"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"让看见","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"用眼睛看而得知对象的存在或样子。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/de9803f6c0fdd20c419b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85360-1-10-2","ko":"음, 저건 다른 배가 우리 앞을 지나가겠다는 항로 신호라네.","zh":"嗯，那是另一艘船要从我们前方经过时发出的航向信号哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음,","meaning":"嗯","explanation":"음：嗯","readings":[{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71111","senseId":"1","lemma":"음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저건","meaning":"那个","explanation":"저거：那个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"저거","audio":"/audio/d3476ad2b3a3fd79be3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29739","senseId":"1","lemma":"저거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배가","meaning":"船","explanation":"배：船；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29729","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞을","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지나가겠다는","meaning":"通过，路过","explanation":"지나가다：通过，路过；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"지나가다","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60216","s